      "value": "@{5c5df2082c5bb810bde843a5|full_name}: I used RiftCat before. Then VRChat-developers upgrade the game and my fps dropped down to 11. After that I don’t use RiftCat for VRChat. What is your fps and what kind of videocard do you use?",
