      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: I use a GTX 1050 TI 4GB video card & limit my frames to 30fps at 1920x1080p with a Britrate somewhere between 14-30Mbps depending on how I feel it's doing. Galaxy S7 with Gear VR & a 5ghs WIFI.\n\nWith safety off I'd say it works pretty well in a world with 10 or so users & will only start lagging around the 15-20 user range. I do suffer from artifacting every couple of minutes but can personally bare with it. Today I tested a different streaming option which did seem to lower that during a quick test.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
