      "value": "@{5b52ba672b29a515be8ff219|full_name}: Locked up your video card and it sounds like they're both similar to one another. It's bittersweet that VRchat will lose on the optimization department in exchange for allowing custom avatars. I wonder what change they did that affect you that greatly though.\n\nMy Gear VR headset has one controller that allows me to use gestures but sadly my problem is that my usb Mic is set on my desk which has decent quality & my headphone mic is pretty poor so this limits me to playing near my computer, and if I'm going to do that I may as well sit down and use the keyboard and mouse along side my controller instead.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
