  "details": "Am using RiftCat with a Galaxy S7 phone & Gear VR as my setup (Believe it emulates the Vive). Up until the update I was able to use my mouse to turn around as I stayed sitted facing my desk but now my view doesn't change when I move the mouse unless I open and am within the game's main menu. One difference I noticed after the update is that my mouse cursor doesn't disappear while the game is active the way it still does while in Desktop mode. Though even while in VR & out of the menu I am able to click on & release items with the mouse, just doesn't seem to register the movement in order to turn my view. Tried uninstalling & reinstalling as well as toggling Comfort Turning & 3rd Person Rotation on and off but none fixed the problem.",
